     "say": {
      "en": "Last video's AVX core could do 48 gigaflops. Will DAXPY get anywhere near that? Almost never. The roofline model, from Williams, Waterman and Patterson in 2009, tells you in one picture what limits a loop, and how fast it can possibly run."
